Error: SHELLCHECK_WARNING (CWE-156):
/usr/libexec/initscripts/legacy-actions/auditd/reload:6:6: warning[SC2046]: Quote this to prevent word splitting.
#    4|   
#    5|   # Check that we are root ... so non-root users stop here
#    6|-> test $(id -u) = 0  ||  exit 4
#    7|   
#    8|   PATH=/sbin:/bin:/usr/bin:/usr/sbin
id -u prints a single number, so the unquoted command substitution can never be split into more words.

