Error: SHELLCHECK_WARNING (CWE-398):
/usr/sbin/augenrules:38:40: warning[SC2172]: Trapping signals by number is not well defined. Prefer signal names.
#   36|   
#   37|   # Delete the interim file on faults
#   38|-> trap 'rm -f ${TmpRules}; exit 1' 1 2 3 13 15
#   39|   
#   40|   try_load() {
Trapping signals by their numbers is the established style of the initscripts family and works on all supported platforms; rewriting it would only risk behavioural changes.
